      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Zero-field SMM-like slow relaxation with fast QTM and a small estimated barrier. χMT at 300 K is 57.31 cm3 K mol−1 (expected 56.68 for four DyIII). χMT decreases to 48.37 cm3 K mol−1 at 12 K then rises to 63.36 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K, indicating dominant ferromagnetic interactions. Magnetization at 1.9 K/70 kOe is 20.96 μB (unsaturated vs 40 μB). χ″ is frequency-dependent below 20 K; Ueff ~4 K, τ0 = 2.65×10−4 s.",
        "measurements": [
